msgid "How long was I out for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "895\t993"
msgid "Oh, just an hour or so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1063\t1115"
msgid "And the boy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116\t1311"
msgid ""
"Taking the last flight back to Tokyo.\\nHe said he wants to apologize to "
"Tamiya in person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1359\t1419"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "1423\t1582"
msgid "He and Tamiya are pretty similar.\\nTwo men driven by emotion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620\t1713"
msgid "I see now why Tamiya took a shine to him."
msgstr ""
